  "verseCount": 7,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "54",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "PSA 54"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "54",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "d"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "To the chief Musician on Neginoth, Maschil,",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "A Psalm",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "of David, when the Ziphims came and said to Saul, Doth not David hide himself with us?",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 54:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Save me, O God, by thy name, and judge me by thy strength.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.54.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.54.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 54:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hear my prayer, O God; give ear to the words of my mouth.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.54.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.54.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 54:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For strangers are risen up against me, and oppressors seek after my soul: they have not set God before them. Selah.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.54.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.54.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 54:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Behold, God",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.54.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.54.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.54.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.54.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mine helper: the Lord",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.54.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.54.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.54.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.54.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "with them that uphold my soul.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.54.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.54.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 54:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He shall reward evil unto mine enemies: cut them off in thy truth.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.54.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.54.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 54:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I will freely sacrifice unto thee: I will praise thy name, O",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.54.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.54.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.54.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.54.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "; for",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.54.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.54.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "it is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.54.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.54.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "good.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.54.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.54.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 54:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For he hath delivered me out of all trouble: and mine eye hath seen",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.54.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.54.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "his desire",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.54.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.54.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "upon mine enemies.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.54.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.54.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "next": {
    "id": "PSA.55",
    "number": "55",
    "bookId": "PSA"
  },
